      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "For more complicated relationships between means and standard deviations, a general formula exists for ascertaining the correct variance-stabilizing transformation. Given the relationship $ \\sigma_{z}=f(\\mu_{z}) $, the appropriate transform is given by a result due to Fisher,",
